<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $0.50/0.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $0.50/0.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade slow.  Compared with</p>
<p>Friday, barrows and gilts $.50 to $.75 higher.Top $60.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>Supply: 600. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.50-60.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     54.00-56.50</p>
<p>Sows:  1.00-2.00 higher. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     52.00</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     53.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     54.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
